  "details": "Secondary cameras that render on a rendertexture only render the objects whose material has specific render queues on Quest. On PC everything works as expected, instead. The bug is also retro-active, so the latest update broke some previous worlds of us that were working before.\n\nTo reproduce it, add to a world a camera that renders a rendertexture, then make that rendertexture visible in the scene (e.g. via a quad with a material referencing that render texture). On PC, the scene works. On Quest, you don't see the avatars, and many elements of the environments, but just the skybox and some transparent element",
